# Scale & cost work (WizCoCo)

When implementing **Firestore cost**, **SMS**, **AI limits**, or **Postgres hybrid**:

1. Open **`docs/scale-cost-roadmap-agent-tasks-ko.md`** and find the next unchecked TASK.
2. Complete **all** `- [ ]` items in that TASK before starting the next.
3. Respect **Phase order** and **선행 (prerequisites)** in the doc.
4. Do **not** import Emulator data into prod Firestore.
5. Commit message prefix: `TASK-0xx:` (English description).
6. Update checkboxes in the task doc when TASK is done (`- [x]`).

Index: `docs/scale-cost-roadmap-README.md`
